# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Env files — catch every variant. Vite inlines anything VITE_* into the build,
# so a leaked .env.production would publish secrets to the dist bundle.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

